{
  "id": "E355",
  "title": "A Stupid Dog",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2019-08-31",
  "synopsis": "Little Le is trying to train her dog, why doesn’t she succeed?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1139/a446bfbe7767d33493aaa26f6d55f358c5d076ca.mp3?1566811766",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "一只笨狗\n \n小乐：我想教我的狗，让它想吃东西的时候就叫一下。\n小雨：这应该不太难吧。\n小乐：我已经教了它很长时间了。\n小雨：那现在怎么样？它会叫了吗？\n小乐：不会。现在如果我不学狗叫，它就不吃东西。",
    "traditional": "一隻笨狗\n \n小樂：我想教我的狗，讓它想吃東西的時候就叫一下。\n小雨：這應該不太難吧。\n小樂：我已經教了它很長時間了。\n小雨：那現在怎麼樣？它會叫了嗎？\n小樂：不會。現在如果我不學狗叫，它就不吃東西。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n \n",
      "traditional": "\n \n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "A Stupid Dog"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小乐：我想教我的狗，让它想吃东西的时候就叫一下。",
      "traditional": "小樂：我想教我的狗，讓它想吃東西的時候就叫一下。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè wǒ xiǎng jiāo wǒ de gǒu ràng tā xiǎng chī dōng xi de shí hou jiù jiào yí xià",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: I want to train my dog to bark when it wants to eat something."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小雨：这应该不太难吧。",
      "traditional": "小雨：這應該不太難吧。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ zhè yīng gāi bú tài nán ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Yu: This shouldn’t be too difficult."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小乐：我已经教了它很长时间了。",
      "traditional": "小樂：我已經教了它很長時間了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè wǒ yǐ jīng jiāo le tā hěn cháng shí jiān le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: I’ve already been training it for a very long time."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小雨：那现在怎么样？它会叫了吗？",
      "traditional": "小雨：那現在怎麼樣？它會叫了嗎？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ nà xiàn zài zěn me yàng tā huì jiào le ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Yu: So how is it now? Does it bark?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小乐：不会。现在如果我不学狗叫，它就不吃东西。",
      "traditional": "小樂：不會。現在如果我不學狗叫，它就不吃東西。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè bú huì xiàn zài rú guǒ wǒ bù xué gǒu jiào tā jiù bù chī dōng xi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: No. Now if I don’t bark like a dog, it won’t eat anything."
    }
  ],
